n fully developed, or steadily level up your Shikigami, and accumulate combo to launch one fatal attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/3f5815a9a63c7f739ebb5c469d3aa6d3.poster.avif?t=1764601432\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/3f5815a9a63c7f739ebb5c469d3aa6d3.webm?t=1764601432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/3f5815a9a63c7f739ebb5c469d3aa6d3.mp4?t=1764601432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Audiovisual Feast of Beautiful Art-Style and Original Voice Actors</strong></h2>Featuring Japanese-style aesthetic scenes, Onmyoji: The Card Game allows you to board the sky cruise, explore the intriguing world of Youkai and record your travels.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/33bd5e44acd94e9476894390936ceae3.avif?t=1764601432\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exquisite and Fun Cards</strong></h2>Exquisite portraits of Shikigami and tailored combat skills with lifelike live 2D effects give you a brand-new CCG experience.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/9816b33c93d92bd3f0e5ef9c82936b03.poster.avif?t=1764601432\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/9816b33c93d92bd3f0e5ef9c82936b03.webm?t=1764601432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183390/extras/9816b33c93d92b